{"id": "20520793", "revid": "45327171", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20520793", "title": "Th\u00fcringer Volkszeitung", "text": "Th\u00fcringer Volkszeitung ('Thuringia People's Newspaper') was a communist newspaper published from Erfurt 1945\u20131946. It was the organ of the Communist Party of Germany in Thuringia. The paper was published thrice weekly in August 1945. It then became a daily newspaper, published from September 2, 1945 to April 6, 1945. It merged with \"Trib\u00fcne\", forming the newspaper \"Th\u00fcringer Volk\"."}
